id: pm-dn8rwl
title: "GH-1173: make merge-receipt evidence diagnostics source-stable and record-addressable"
description: "Loss-aware health currently reports only an invalid evidence count, can differ between a long-lived clone and a pristine worktree of the same commit, and recommends a command that repeats the same opaque count. Extend the public SDK report with privacy-safe record identities, source/reason classifications, clone-local provenance, actionable remediation, and dangling history-reference detection without exposing malformed content."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: "area:merge","area:sdk",diagnostics,"github:1173","security:evidence"
created_at: "2026-09-01T10:07:41.769Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-01T12:14:44.339Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-01T11:41:54.086Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-01T11:41:54.086Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 360
acceptance_criteria: "Public SDK contracts expose bounded invalid-evidence detail with stable reason codes and source provenance; CLI merge report and health surface the same complete detail without malformed contents; identical tracked inputs cannot be silently reclassified by unrelated caches; dangling history receipt references are visible with safe remediation; tests cover malformed, unreadable, missing, clone-local, clean-worktree, and output-budget boundaries."
goal: project management = context management
objective: Make durable merge evidence self-explaining and safe to repair
value: Agents can preserve project history instead of deleting evidence to silence opaque gates
impact: Prevents destructive false remediation and makes merge-integrity failures graph- and record-addressable
why_now: GH-1173 documents actual deletion of receipts and history after an opaque gate failure.
parent: pm-dj98
risk: high
confidence: high
severity: high
environment: "Long-lived Git clones with clone-local receipt evidence, runtime caches, and generated search state"
repro_steps: Compare pm health --strict-exit and pm health --check-only --full in a long-lived clone versus a pristine worktree at the same commit; inspect merge_receipt_evidence_invalid and its remediation.
resolution: "Added exact and bounded invalid-evidence counts/details with source and stable reason codes; privacy-safe receipt ids or SHA-256 locators; CLI merge report, health, and validate parity; pending/reconciled history-reference detection with item/line coordinates; non-destructive remediation; public SDK barrel exports; generated contracts, tests, and documentation."
expected_result: Every invalid record is identified without exposing malformed content; clone-local versus durable source is explicit; missing history references are visible; remediation enumerates evidence and preserves append-only history.
actual_result: "PR #1175 first head passed all hosted gates including Windows Node 24. Local 8,244-test exact-coverage suite and full static gates passed; temporary CLI acceptance proved record reasons, bounded output, missing-reference coordinates, and remediation. Both Cubic P2 findings were fixed in the reviewed closeout tree."
component: SDK merge-receipt evidence and health governance
