comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-01T10:07:41.769Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: exact GH-1173 search across all statuses returned zero. Canonical predecessors pm-baksix and pm-z1z96w shipped loss-aware receipt reporting but do not provide record-level reasons, cache/source provenance, or dangling-reference diagnostics; this is a post-delivery recurrence and extension, not a duplicate."
  "2026-09-01T10:14:39.100Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: focused SDK, health, validate, and remediation suite first failed on the missing detail contract, then passed 35/35 after implementation. Malformed contents remain absent from output; safe receipt ids or SHA-256 filename locators identify candidates; detail is capped at 100 with exact full count and truncation receipt."
  "2026-09-01T11:14:27.887Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: public SDK reports exact invalid_evidence_count plus bounded invalid_evidence identities, source and stable reason codes, and truncation; CLI merge report, health, and validate preserve the same privacy boundary. Health additionally resolves durable history context.merge.receipts references against pending and reconciled evidence and reports exact item/history-line coordinates or SHA-256 locators with non-destructive recovery guidance."
  "2026-09-01T11:14:29.746Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: linked focused suite passed 39/39; repository suite passed 594/594 files and 8,243/8,243 tests with exact 100% statements (60,696/60,696), branches (45,895/45,895), functions (12,629/12,629), and lines (58,437/58,437). Temporary-repository CLI acceptance proved two record-level invalid candidates, one missing history reference, bounded privacy-safe output, and executable remediation. Static quality source gate is green with 100% source/export/member docstrings and zero file-length, complexity, duplication, boundary, or pragma-budget violations."
  "2026-09-01T11:27:01.088Z","harness:codex","Final local gate correction: after replacing coverage pragmas with real injected filesystem negative controls, the repository suite passed 594/594 files and 8,244/8,244 tests at exact 100% statements (60,700/60,700), branches (45,900/45,900), functions (12,629/12,629), and lines (58,439/58,439). Full pnpm quality:static also passed, including ESLint, zero jscpd clones, contract and SDK snapshots, package boundaries, grammar/parity, refusal closure, token budgets, tracker graph quality, and record integrity."
  "2026-09-01T11:41:53.107Z","harness:codex","Hosted and review evidence: PR #1175 head 1484629 passed the complete GitHub matrix, including Windows regression Node 24 in 3m31s, all four coverage shards and exact coverage gate, static/smoke/type/compat gates, CodeQL, Semgrep, Trivy, DeepScan, CodeFactor, Codecov, CodSpeed, and Cubic. Cubic identified two valid P2 gaps; both are fixed in the closeout tree: MergeReceiptInvalidEvidence is exported from the merge and aggregate SDK barrels, and the ancestor classifier now inspects the exact requested path before walking upward."
  "2026-09-01T11:59:53.553Z","harness:codex","Exact closeout evidence: final repository coverage passed 594/594 files and 8,244/8,244 tests at exact 100% statements (60,700/60,700), branches (45,900/45,900), functions (12,629/12,629), and lines (58,439/58,439). Full quality:static passed after its defect-evidence ratchet correctly required and then accepted production_defect plus structured gate_strengthened evidence. pm-changelog 2026.9.1 generated and check-verified CHANGELOG.md."
  "2026-09-01T12:14:44.338Z","harness:codex","Exact-head CodeRabbit review found three valid closeout improvements: centralize the cleartext receipt-id privacy predicate, make the real chmod unreadable-file test skip uid 0 while retained injected negative controls cover the branch, and restore pm-z1z96w as the typed recurs_from predecessor. All are incorporated through source/test edits and an append-only pm mutation."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-01T11:14:28.374Z","harness:codex","Durable history references must be checked against reconciled as well as pending receipts; filtering to pending before the cross-check creates false missing-evidence findings after correct settlement. Enumerate evidence before proposing remediation, and never rewrite append-only history to silence a clone-local diagnostic."
